#: ../../user_interface/shortcuts.rst:0
msgid ""
"On active track: Cut the clip at the playhead position and delete the "
"remainder."
msgstr ""
"Na dejavni stezi: odreže posnetek na položaju predvajalne glave in izbriše "
"preostanek."

#: ../../user_interface/shortcuts.rst:0
msgid ""
"On active track: Cut, delete and remove the empty space use :ref:"
"`ripple_trim_to_playhead`."
msgstr ""
"Na dejavni stezi: izreže, izbriše in odstrani uporabljeni prostor :ref:"
"`ripple_trim_to_playhead`."

#: ../../user_interface/shortcuts.rst:0
msgid ""
"On active track: Cut the clip at the playhead position and delete the "
"section from the start of the clip to the playhead."
msgstr ""
"Na dejavni stezi: odreže posnetek na položaju predvajalne glave in izbriše "
"del od začetka posnetka do položaja predvajalne glave."

#: ../../user_interface/shortcuts.rst:0
msgid "Track selection in general and for 3-point-editing"
msgstr "Izbor stez na splošno in za 3-točkovno montažo"

#: ../../user_interface/shortcuts.rst:0
msgid ""
"Multicam tool: You trim the clips in the desired track while the timeline is "
"playing"
msgstr ""
"Orodje za večkamerne posnetke: krajšajte posnetke na želeni stezi, medtem ko "
"se časovnica predvaja"

#: ../../user_interface/shortcuts.rst:0
msgid ""
"Select a video or audio track in the timeline (up/down arrow key) and set it "
"as source with :kbd:`Shift+T`."
msgstr ""
"Izberite video ali zvočno stezo v časovnici (smerna tipka navzgor/navzdol) "
"in jo nastavite kot vir z :kbd:`dvigalko+T`."

