#: ../../user_interface/shortcuts.rst:28
msgid "Keyboard Shortcuts"
msgstr "Tipke za bližnjice"

#: ../../user_interface/shortcuts.rst:48
msgid ""
"Kdenlive has many keyboard shortcuts already defined by default. You can "
"change these anytime through :menuselection:`Menu --> Settings --> Configure "
"keyboard shortcuts` or by pressing :kbd:`Ctrl+Alt+,` . See also the :ref:"
"`configure_shortcuts` chapter."
msgstr ""
"Kdenlive ima številne privzeto določene tipke za bližnjice. Te lahko "
"kadarkoli spremenit prek :menuselection:`Meni --> Nastavitve --> Prilagodi "
"tipke za bližnjice` ali s kombinacijo tipk :kbd:`krmilka+izmenjalka+,` . "
"Glejte tudi poglavje :ref:`configure_shortcuts`."

#: ../../user_interface/shortcuts.rst:50
msgid ""
"You can also download keyboard shortcut definition files (aka Kdenlive "
"Keyboard Schemes) from the |kde_store|.  See also the :ref:"
"`useful_resources` chapter."
msgstr ""
"Lahko tudi prenesete datoteke z definicijami tipk za bližnjice (t.i. "
"Kdenlive Keyboard Schemes) iz |Trgovine KDE|.  Glejte tudi poglavje :ref:"
"`useful_resources`."

